            "title": "凱樂士科技全球布局提速　新美巴三地據點啟用",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"672\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/cf24175929086b6f986f06c6d6b63bd3505cf2a7b8f153fcd5f1aaf7119dff18/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w1200%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fthe_bamboo_works_186%2Fc77edcb6492bc123bfd1a9e23f7bd624\" width=\"1200\"/></div></figure></div>",
