        {
            "title": "日本煙草傳與奧馳亞聯合收購英美煙草旗下帝國品牌，股價急升",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"757\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ca62ee3d40e4a12bf9801b5cac17f148c31dcf66f8ef79a17463d5a301cc31c3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w1200%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEB1P0B0_M.jpg\" width=\"1200\"/></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com - 日本煙草國際株式會社（Japan Tobacco Inc，TYO:2914）股價週五大幅上漲，此前有報道指該公司正與奧馳亞集團（Altria Group）考慮聯合收購英國帝國品牌公司（Imperial Brands）。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">日本煙草（TYO:2914）股價上漲4.1%，報5,754.0日圓，同期日經225指數亦上漲約1%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">彭博社週四報道，日本煙草與奧馳亞正考慮以全現金方式聯合收購帝國品牌，若交易成功，將催生全球最大香煙製造商之一。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-53ab356a-ba1b-3140-b9ae-3d39bf006a91-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">奧馳亞已公開表示正考慮提出收購要約，並正與另一方進行磋商，但未披露對方身份。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">帝國品牌旗下擁有多個知名品牌，包括大衛杜夫（Davidoff）及高盧人（Gauloises），產品行銷全球。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">此次收購對日本煙草而言具有重要戰略意義。該公司股價本月早些時候曾大幅下挫，原因是其俄羅斯子公司遭莫斯科當局沒收，令其失去對相關業務的控制權。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">日本煙草表示，此次資產被沒收將為公司帶來87億美元的損失。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
